<title>UK: Baltic Freight Index fell seven points to 1,427.</title>
<headline>Baltic Freight Index fell seven points to 1,427.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Baltic Freight Index for spot dry cargo shipping rates fell to 1,427 today from 1,434 on April 10, with the base being Jan 4 1985 equals 1,000. The BFI is based on the following sub-indices with rates in dollars per tonne.</p>
<p> Route Index     Rate   Prev Index  Rate</p>
